        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_statfs_and_check",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_statfs_and_check\n\nlod_statfs_and_check() refreshes a target's cached statfs data via\ndt_statfs_info() and maintains ld_active_tgt_count/ltd_active as the\ntarget's usability changes; every QoS/RR allocator calls it before\nconsidering a target. It was untested.\n\nAdd lod_statfs_check_test.c, covering a healthy target staying\nactive, a target going full (OS_STATFS_ENOSPC) turning inactive and\ndecrementing the active count, a disconnected target's -ENOTCONN\ngetting remapped to -EREMOTEIO, and the @reserve parameter forcing\n-ENOSPC on an otherwise healthy target without marking it inactive.\nUses mock_tgt for the fake target and its canned statfs reply.\n\nExport lod_statfs_and_check(), needed by the new test module, and\nregister it in lustre/kunit/Makefile, KUNIT.modules_list and\nlod/KUNIT.list.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [claude-code]\nChange-Id: If7fdcde795aa02ce2128a8f954752948527c26b9\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
